WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.066 --> 00:00:02.202
Fox has to pay Dominion voting systems

00:00:02.202 --> 00:00:06.306
$787 million for making false statements

00:00:06.306 --> 00:00:07.474
about the voting machines.

00:00:07.474 --> 00:00:08.708
It was a huge story

00:00:08.708 --> 00:00:09.809
for the past two years.

00:00:09.809 --> 00:00:10.944
In the media world,

00:00:10.944 --> 00:00:13.079
but very rarely mentioned on Fox.

00:00:13.079 --> 00:00:14.748
So what do Fox viewers know

00:00:14.748 --> 00:00:15.982
about what happened?

00:00:15.982 --> 00:00:16.583
I sat down

00:00:16.583 --> 00:00:18.118
with a group of them to find out.

00:00:18.118 --> 00:00:21.354
Here is our pulse of the people

00:00:21.855 --> 00:00:22.622
Show of hands.

00:00:22.622 --> 00:00:24.758
How many of you had heard about this

00:00:24.758 --> 00:00:26.426
two year legal battle

00:00:26.426 --> 00:00:28.228
between Dominion and Fox

00:00:28.228 --> 00:00:31.865
before our producer called you

00:00:33.233 --> 00:00:34.667
two of you had heard about it.

00:00:34.667 --> 00:00:36.236
I was aware

00:00:36.636 --> 00:00:37.437
of the claims

00:00:37.437 --> 00:00:37.837
that it made

00:00:37.837 --> 00:00:38.905
against Dominion

00:00:38.905 --> 00:00:41.641
and the allegations of voter fraud

00:00:41.641 --> 00:00:42.342
more broadly.

00:00:42.342 --> 00:00:43.143
I just wasn't aware

00:00:43.143 --> 00:00:45.412
that Dominion had filed

00:00:45.412 --> 00:00:46.713
essentially a defamation

00:00:46.713 --> 00:00:48.114
suit against Fox.

00:00:48.114 --> 00:00:50.517
How many of you are surprised

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:53.953
by the $787 million settlement

00:00:53.953 --> 00:00:55.989
that Fox agreed to pay to Dominion

00:00:56.289 --> 00:01:00.360
for broadcasting false information about

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:01.327
the voting systems

00:01:04.064 --> 00:01:04.697
None of you.

00:01:04.697 --> 00:01:05.765
Ragan, your thoughts?

00:01:05.765 --> 00:01:08.101
It was damning to Fox.

00:01:09.002 --> 00:01:11.237
So at some point

00:01:11.604 --> 00:01:13.740
you have to make a business decision

00:01:13.740 --> 00:01:15.942
on both sides. And I.

00:01:16.543 --> 00:01:17.577
I thought, you know,

00:01:17.577 --> 00:01:19.045
it would probably be in Vox's

00:01:19.045 --> 00:01:19.746
best interests

00:01:19.746 --> 00:01:20.747
to settle

00:01:20.747 --> 00:01:21.681
for obviously,

00:01:21.681 --> 00:01:24.184
fox made those claims in some capacity

00:01:24.951 --> 00:01:27.687
and Dominion took issue with it, so

00:01:28.288 --> 00:01:28.822
they sued them.

00:01:28.822 --> 00:01:30.857
But I came away from

00:01:30.857 --> 00:01:31.357
the court

00:01:31.357 --> 00:01:33.927
filing with was

00:01:33.927 --> 00:01:35.628
a lot of this is a matter of opinion.

00:01:35.628 --> 00:01:37.530
This has been over a year. Correct.

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:40.033
So for them to come to the table

00:01:40.033 --> 00:01:43.436
with no evidence to back up their claims,

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:46.473
that's really frustrating because,

00:01:46.773 --> 00:01:49.709
quite frankly, we've had millions

00:01:49.709 --> 00:01:50.477
of Americans

00:01:50.477 --> 00:01:51.511
that have been doing their homework

00:01:51.511 --> 00:01:52.712
since 20, 20.

00:01:52.712 --> 00:01:54.380
It's pretty easy to find some

00:01:55.615 --> 00:01:56.583
funny stuff.

00:01:56.583 --> 00:01:58.084
I'm wondering how you feel

00:01:58.084 --> 00:01:58.785
knowing that

00:01:58.785 --> 00:01:59.853
one of the things that came out

00:01:59.853 --> 00:02:00.820
during Discovery

00:02:00.820 --> 00:02:02.255
was how different

00:02:02.255 --> 00:02:04.524
the hosts felt behind the scenes

00:02:04.791 --> 00:02:06.659
than what they were saying on the air.

00:02:06.659 --> 00:02:10.563
For instance, when Tucker Carlson said

00:02:10.830 --> 00:02:12.198
behind the scenes

00:02:12.198 --> 00:02:14.400
after the election on November 23rd

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:15.301
20, 20,

00:02:15.301 --> 00:02:16.136
he says,

00:02:16.136 --> 00:02:17.770
I had to try to make the White House

00:02:17.770 --> 00:02:19.172
disavow Sidney Powell,

00:02:19.172 --> 00:02:20.773
which they obviously should have done

00:02:20.773 --> 00:02:21.808
long before.

00:02:21.808 --> 00:02:23.810
Laura Ingraham in her texts response.

00:02:23.810 --> 00:02:25.411
No serious lawyer

00:02:25.411 --> 00:02:27.780
could believe what they were saying.

00:02:28.815 --> 00:02:29.782
Well, I,

00:02:29.782 --> 00:02:30.850
I lost

00:02:30.850 --> 00:02:32.952
I'd lost trust in them prior to that.

00:02:33.520 --> 00:02:37.023
Anyway, when when Fox was calling out

00:02:37.023 --> 00:02:37.590
the election,

00:02:37.590 --> 00:02:39.092
I know a lot of people felt this way

00:02:39.092 --> 00:02:40.560
they were calling out the election

00:02:40.560 --> 00:02:42.562
prematurely for Arizona.

00:02:42.562 --> 00:02:44.631
And then after that,

00:02:44.631 --> 00:02:46.533
you know, there's been a lot of talking

00:02:46.533 --> 00:02:47.734
on both sides of their mouth.

00:02:47.734 --> 00:02:49.002
The audience is not looking

00:02:49.002 --> 00:02:50.336
to be lied to.

00:02:50.336 --> 00:02:52.539
It's looking to give context to something

00:02:52.539 --> 00:02:53.940
that we know is true

00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:55.608
from a certain perspective.

00:02:55.608 --> 00:02:57.377
And that's that's got a value.

00:02:57.377 --> 00:02:59.579
But there is a line not to cross.

00:02:59.579 --> 00:02:59.979
And once

00:02:59.979 --> 00:03:02.148
you know that something is not true,

00:03:02.148 --> 00:03:03.249
you need to let them know

00:03:03.249 --> 00:03:04.184
because then they can move

00:03:04.184 --> 00:03:06.219
on, move on and accept it.

00:03:06.586 --> 00:03:08.454
They lost the conservatives

00:03:08.454 --> 00:03:11.524
lost this last election not because

00:03:12.325 --> 00:03:13.660
of some nefarious,

00:03:13.660 --> 00:03:15.328
deep state, shadowy thing.

00:03:15.328 --> 00:03:17.197
So, you know, Alison, you spoke about

00:03:18.331 --> 00:03:21.000
well, you know, certain Fox hosts

00:03:21.301 --> 00:03:22.635
knew about this,

00:03:22.635 --> 00:03:25.004
but they went forward with it anyway.

00:03:25.004 --> 00:03:25.939
What one?

00:03:25.939 --> 00:03:28.541
I'm really happy that they have

00:03:30.176 --> 00:03:32.245
divergent opinions in private

00:03:32.245 --> 00:03:33.279
and they say, gosh, you know,

00:03:33.279 --> 00:03:34.581
I'm not really sure about this.

00:03:34.581 --> 00:03:35.982
I think they're going to learn a lesson

00:03:35.982 --> 00:03:37.417
this that this lesson hasn't happened.

00:03:37.417 --> 00:03:40.553
To cost them $787 million,

00:03:40.553 --> 00:03:42.789
which is a number I can't hardly imagine.

00:03:42.789 --> 00:03:44.257
And what is that lesson? Right.

00:03:44.257 --> 00:03:46.259
And what is that lesson

00:03:47.794 --> 00:03:50.029
Well, I think that lesson is that

00:03:50.029 --> 00:03:54.400
the news should be based wholly on truth.

00:03:54.601 --> 00:03:55.168
There's a certain

00:03:55.168 --> 00:03:57.003
level of willful blindness

00:03:57.003 --> 00:03:59.138
but people see what they want to see.

00:03:59.138 --> 00:03:59.973
And that's true

00:03:59.973 --> 00:04:01.874
on the left and it's true on the right.

00:04:01.874 --> 00:04:04.644
But I don't look to any of the networks,

00:04:04.644 --> 00:04:06.379
including Fox,

00:04:06.379 --> 00:04:08.114
as the ultimate arbiter of truth.

00:04:08.114 --> 00:04:09.682
One more question, show of hands.

00:04:09.682 --> 00:04:11.818
How many of you will still

00:04:11.818 --> 00:04:13.453
be devoted Fox watchers

00:04:17.924 --> 00:04:18.558
I mean,

00:04:19.225 --> 00:04:19.592
not sure

00:04:19.592 --> 00:04:22.929
if it's devoted, but I don't think so.

00:04:23.396 --> 00:04:25.231
Three used to being the odd man out.

00:04:25.231 --> 00:04:26.099
That's okay.

00:04:26.099 --> 00:04:27.166
So, guys, of the three

00:04:27.166 --> 00:04:29.335
who are still going to be Fox watchers

00:04:29.335 --> 00:04:30.937
in, will you take

00:04:30.937 --> 00:04:31.904
what they say

00:04:31.904 --> 00:04:33.172
with more of a grain of salt?

00:04:33.172 --> 00:04:33.806
Now,

00:04:35.708 --> 00:04:37.010
As I stated earlier,

00:04:37.010 --> 00:04:40.280
I take everyone with a grain of salt.

00:04:40.380 --> 00:04:41.814
Reagan, what about you? Will you be.

00:04:41.814 --> 00:04:43.850
Will you be listening to Fox with through

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:45.184
a different lens,

00:04:45.184 --> 00:04:46.653
taking it more with a grain of salt

00:04:46.653 --> 00:04:48.955
or you should always look within

00:04:48.955 --> 00:04:52.258
when something big like this happens.

00:04:52.258 --> 00:04:53.259
A big case like this.

00:04:53.259 --> 00:04:54.761
So yeah,

00:04:54.761 --> 00:04:55.862
I think there's going to be

00:04:55.862 --> 00:04:57.363
an extra filter

00:04:57.363 --> 00:05:00.033
on that lens when I watch Tucker.

00:05:00.133 --> 00:05:01.801
Ryan, will you be watching

00:05:01.801 --> 00:05:02.869
through a different filter?

00:05:02.869 --> 00:05:03.503
As Reagan said,

00:05:05.471 --> 00:05:07.373
I think I'm going to be expanding my net

00:05:07.373 --> 00:05:07.907
some more.

00:05:07.907 --> 00:05:08.341
Allison,

00:05:08.341 --> 00:05:10.710
you might be winning a new future viewer.

00:05:10.810 --> 00:05:12.211
But also,

00:05:12.211 --> 00:05:12.478
you know,

00:05:12.478 --> 00:05:14.480
the things that Fox News is showing

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:15.848
is not necessarily

00:05:15.848 --> 00:05:17.884
the things that CNN is showing

00:05:18.151 --> 00:05:19.519
and expanding mind.

00:05:19.519 --> 00:05:21.054
That will be, I think, helpful.

00:05:21.054 --> 00:05:22.789
So that I don't see these

00:05:22.789 --> 00:05:24.257
I don't have these blind spots

00:05:24.257 --> 00:05:27.860
like this Dominion case.

00:05:28.428 --> 00:05:29.996
Our thanks to our panel there.

00:05:29.996 --> 00:05:31.731
And if you want to comment on it,

00:05:31.731 --> 00:05:32.565
feel free to find me

00:05:32.565 --> 00:05:34.734
on social media at Alisyn Camerota.

